		line=1345,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Lunch break─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Served with a summons by Elsa, I make my way towards the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Considering what we just discovered about Kanami, I'll need to stay on my toes.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Welcome. You're right on time.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Sitting in her chair at the head of the room, Elsa greets me with that perfect smile of hers.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"She sets down the pen in her hand with an elegant flourish.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, what do you want with me?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Straight to business, aren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why don't you relax a little? This room is just as much yours now as well.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"She gestures towards an open seat, and I obediently sit down.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fancy a spot of tea?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's fine.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And some fruit pound cake?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's fine.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Great. Wait just a minute─I'll get it ready.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"For some reason, Elsa stands up.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, really, it's fine.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Right, that's why I'm preparing it.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"It looks like my intentions aren't getting across.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In this case, 'it's fine' means 'I'll pass.'”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh? Oh, really?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My apologies. I took it to mean that you were looking forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Elsa sits back down, a blush crossing her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You know what? The Imperial language is way too complicated!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And besides, would it really kill you to just enjoy some tea and cake?!”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I swear, why did I even bother buying the good stuff for you anyways...”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, I'm sorry, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Smoothing out the hair she just mussed up, Elsa leans forward to face me.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Actually, there's someplace I'd like you to take me.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Where do you think that could be?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No idea.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I don't like it when she tests me like this.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Mi-yo-shi.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...What?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Elsa flashes a grin at me, as though entirely oblivious to my wariness.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I know that it's a favourite hangout for the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But I just want to pay it a visit purely out of personal interest.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I only heard this from an acquaintance, but they serve some mighty 'fine' food there, don't they?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In terms of the food itself, it's very 'fine' indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You seem like a regular, so would you mind bringing me along with you?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"What's Elsa playing at here?",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Is she really only after a taste of Miyoshi's food?",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, but I think I'll have to pass.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are aware of what the warriors think of you, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, the more short-tempered ones just might jump me if I decided to show my face there.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"An unprovoked attack on Elsa would be the perfect pretext for the Republican Army to conduct a thorough investigation.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"We have to avoid that at all costs.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just give it up, won't you?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, I suppose I'll have to go alone in that case.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Surely they wouldn't refuse me entry just because I'm a Republican?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now, look...”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"If she's set on going no matter what, then it's obviously much better if I'm accompanying her.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"She knew from the start that this was how it was going to play out, didn't she?",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Fine. I'll take you.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I swear, you're a real pain in the ass.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, not happy with it?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you rather have some different company?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"It's fine.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll go ahead and take you with me, but I can't guarantee your safety.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm putting my life in your hands, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not being able to protect the lady you're dining with would be considered awfully shameful in the Republic, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I wonder what a man of the Empire would say to that?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“See for yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I don't like it, but she's really twisted my arm here.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Let's hope both she and Miyoshi manage to make it out of this in one piece...",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Elsa arrives at the front of the restaurant right on time.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"She was at least considerate enough to get out of her car a fair distance away and walk the rest of the way.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you alone?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yep. You're all the escort that I'll need, isn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The lights of a passing car illuminate her figure from behind.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"The feminine curves of her body stand out in sharp relief against the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"It's the first time I've seen her out of her uniform.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Her smart, casual outfit accentuates her voluptuous figure that many Imperial women would be jealous of.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What's with that face you're making?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was just thinking that outfit looks good on you.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"She shows me a charming smile.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"It's a smile full of heartfelt happiness, enough to make me forget for a second that she's an enemy soldier.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I was actually worried that I might be a bit underdressed.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, it's perfectly fine.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It might look pretty intimidating from the outside, but it's actually a fairly casual place.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's almost like they're trying to discourage everyone except warriors from coming in.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wonder.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Just as Elsa says, Miyoshi's imposing exterior is designed in part to keep outsiders away.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"She probably knows that perfectly well.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, shall we?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wow...”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Elsa's somewhat tense expression brightens at once upon seeing the interior.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This place is a lot classier than I was expecting!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I half expected to see some rowdy warriors getting into a scuffle or two.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really think I'd be a regular at a place like that?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Welcome.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san pokes her head out from the kitchen.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is Elsa, the one I called about earlier.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Good evening. It's a pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Welcome to my humble restaurant. Please, make yourself at home.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Quite the lovely establishment you've got here.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, thank you kindly.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're one of the warriors' commanding officers, right?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I hear you made quite the name for yourself during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That is all in the past now.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“The only blade I wield now is my chef's knife.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Now then, please allow me to show you your seats.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, thank you. But first...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Elsa casually reaches into her bag and pulls out a machine pistol.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"The restaurant tenses up all at once.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Elsa twirls the gun around and points the grip towards Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you mind holding on to this for me?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If you'd like, I'd be happy to hold on to that one as well.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san's eyes are pointed right towards Elsa's calf.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You've sure got a keen eye, hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Grinning wryly to herself, Elsa pulls out a small, semi-automatic pistol from her boot.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Mutsumi receives it with a gracious smile.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"She may have hung up her blade, but her situational awareness is as sharp as ever.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Right this way, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san leads us to a private table at the back of the restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"It's a low-seating table, often reserved for important negotiations.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh my, if it isn't Inou-san.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kept me waiting long enough. Mind if I join in?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Truth be told, I was looking forward to dining alone with Tokita-kun...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Then I'll excuse myself.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Hotori moves to stand up.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, hold it.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was the one who invited Hotori. I want her here for safety.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I know, I know. Just a joke.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san, would you care to dine with us?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"The three of us take our seats.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Hotori is sitting beside me, the two of us facing Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What about Miyaguni-san?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I thought you always ate together with her.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She has some personal business, so she couldn't make it today.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh. That's a shame.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Truthfully, Akari is just sitting on her hands at home right now.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Since there's no telling how things will unfold, I managed to persuade her to sit this one out.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Almost immediately, our food is served.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"The first dish is stewed winter melon with minced prawns.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“These sure are some unusual vegetables.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You don't see them often around here, but they're eaten commonly out east.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What are these green beans mixed in with the shrimp?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Edamame. Or would 'soybeans' be easier to understand?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, soybeans!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Elsa keeps up her barrage of questions, asking about everything from the food, to the serving utensils, to the chopstick rests.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"She seems to have quite the genuine interest in Imperial culture.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now, let's dig in!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Elsa takes up her chopsticks with practiced motions.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll have you know I've done some practicing.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I thought I'd have a much rougher time, but it's really not so hard!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Go and give it a try with the soybeans, if you're gonna talk such a big game.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You'd do well not to underestimate me.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Er, just eat like normal, please.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san... feast your eyes on what I'm capable of!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Pointedly ignoring me, Elsa directs her chopsticks towards her quarry: a single, lone edamame bean.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"She grabbed it on the first try!",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aaah!”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Or so I thought, but the bean swiftly gets the better of her and draws a wide arc through the air...",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa & Soujin & Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah...” “Ah...” “Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"...Before landing smack dab on Hotori's forehead.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Even as Hotori furrows her brow, it remains stubbornly stuck there.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah, umm... Sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good thing that wasn't a bullet, huh, Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I live to see another day.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It would appear that you still need more training, Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Hotori casually plucks the soybean off her forehead and pops it into her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're gonna eat that?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A true warrior abhors wasting food.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“'Simplicity and frugality in all things,' was it?”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Elsa recites one of the three tenets of all warriors.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've done your homework.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Her Majesty certainly taught me well.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Elsa calmly retorts as she carefully watches for my reaction.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Though she's wearing her usual, perfect smile, it doesn't reach her deadly serious eyes.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...It certainly makes sense that Her Majesty would know a thing or two about the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Spare me the little charade, won't you?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, you two received the exact same upbringing,\ndidn't you, Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"...Onii-sama, huh?",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"It seems like she's sniffed out my relationship with Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Swallowing my tension, I speak in as measured of a tone as I can muster.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see. So this is the main course you had in mind for today.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You won't find it on the menu, though.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Did Kanami spill the beans to you?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I led her right into it. It's not her fault.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"After a final sip of her tea, Elsa sets down her cup with purpose, as though ready to get down to brass tacks.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“When did you first figure out her true identity?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"I've known that Empress Hisui is an impostor ever since I first met Akari.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"I'll have to be very careful with my answer.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You seem awfully calm about it, all things considered.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, didn't you just find out that your own lord, dearer to you than life itself, is an impostor?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're just not showing it.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm...?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"She looks appraisingly into our unflinching eyes.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What do you intend to do about Operation Bellflower now?”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you really rise up in the name of a false Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This isn't the time to start looking for the real one.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And for now, we need Empress Hisui as the banner to rally the warriors around.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll do whatever it takes to take down Okonogi, even if it means compromising on our fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I say as much as I can without overselling it.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"In truth, our goal remains the same as it has always been.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"We intend to unite the Sworn Blades under Empress Hisui and stage an armed uprising.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Our objective: to storm the Imperial Palace and eliminate Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Up until this point, we fully intend to cooperate with Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"But the tides are rapidly turning against our favor.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Kanami isn't cooperating in the way we expected of her, and Elsa is growing increasingly wary of us.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"If Elsa gets too suspicious, our alliance will fall apart.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"If that happens, she won't return the spellblades we were promised.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"We can't afford to let Elsa see through our intentions until we take down Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about your end?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you intend to keep Kanami on the throne?”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The only thing that matters is her influence. I couldn't care less about the legitimacy of her lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That is, as long as the real one doesn't come crawling out from the woodwork.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you have any leads on the real Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Apparently she's still out there somewhere, but I still have no idea who she even is.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her Majesty is still alive?!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"I do my best to feign a shocked reaction.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What about you?”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We... don't have a single idea.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What a shame.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then, can we take this to mean that Operation Bellflower will proceed as planned?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well I, for one, certainly hope so.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So do we, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Elsa stares long and hard at the two of us.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"It's as though she's trying to see through to our true intentions.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Very well. I'll take you at your word for now.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"She finally shows us a smile that reaches her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“When everything is all over, the two of you siblings can finally live together in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That would indeed be nice... But Kanami is guilty of impersonating the Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She cannot know peace, not for as long as she lives.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You intend to make her atone for her crimes?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is what she herself wants.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“With her life as payment?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"I silently nod.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“She really deserves better... You know, she told me the only reason she became Empress was in order to find you again.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Are you okay with this, Inou-san?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It must come to pass.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can sympathize with Kanami all too well, but all crimes demand their requital.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Theft doesn't suddenly become justified even if you're starving.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I think I can understand your logic.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even in the Republic, if someone impersonated the president and tried to run the country in their place, they'd probably be executed.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But you're family, aren't you? I don't know how you can just give up and accept it, even if it's what she wants.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you expect me to lose my composure and make a fool of myself as an expression of love?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, I think that if you truly love someone, it's only natural to make a fool of yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Warriors treasure their families just as much as anyone else.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even so, to lose your composure for any reason is to behave no different than a crying child.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors would call that immaturity.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To carry any hesitation within your heart goes against the way of the warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hesitation will only dull your blade and impede you from seeing through your fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Unless you train your heart to remain ever vigilant and never stray from the righteous path, you cannot hope to be ready to serve at a moment's notice.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You lot are as ≪stoic≫ as ever, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Elsa murmurs to herself with a resigned sigh.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What does that mean?”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Take it to mean that you're always too hard on yourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe we've said it before, but we warriors need to be ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"desperate",
{"/font"},
" about how we live our lives.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We cannot afford to spare even a moment of laxity in questioning the depth of our fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so, it is all in service to our fealty that we strive to banish the hesitation from our hearts.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“An ideology that indoctrinates soldiers into never harboring any unnecessary thoughts, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Elsa sets down her chopsticks, staring at us with eyes overflowing with pity.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've also mentioned this before, but the warriors' philosophy seems like nothing more than ≪Stockholm Syndrome.≫”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, for the people on top, what more could you ask for than soldiers who are nothing more than mindless killing machines?”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All throughout your history, you've been used as an awfully convenient tool by those who are in power.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And worst of all, they've gotten you to convince yourselves that this is your blessing.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"I'm sure that must be how Elsa sees it.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if that's true, I think there could be nothing worse than to lose my composure and show hesitation on the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Standing upon that hallowed ground where people put their very lives on the line, I need to know what it is I'm fighting to protect.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I absolutely must know what it is I'm laying down my life for.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As a soldier yourself, can you say that you're truly capable of fighting without hesitation?”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I...”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Elsa sits up a little straighter.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have no hesitation.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I fight for the sake of all those who suffer under tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"The three of us fall into silence for some time.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...What do you think?”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“About what?”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“About why I fight.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you are truly capable of standing upon the battlefield without any hesitation, I think you are blessed indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's all I can say.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just like how we don't accept your criticism, in the end, you are the only person who can find your own resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But you should know that I sincerely respect anyone, friend or foe, who is able to fight without hesitation.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Overcoming your hesitation is a difficult feat indeed, one that is truly worthy of respect.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"The reason I always say “a warrior is his lord's blade” is in part an attempt to convince myself of this truth.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Otherwise, hesitation would soon creep into my own immature heart.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
